'''Sinner Snache''' (インフェルにょろ, ''Inferunyoro'', '''Infernyoro''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Snache]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

