|money drop = 120¢ - 474¢
}}

==Enemy==
An average peon that almost any attacker can handle with relative ease. The actual danger posed by Sinner Snache is the potential aftermath of killing it: a level 1 [[Surge Attack|Surge]] deep in your lines, which can be problematic if this enemy is present in large quantities or buffed to an extent, and if your army doesn't have many anti-Surge units.

==Strategy==
Because of its dangerous [[Surge Attack#Death Surge|Death Surge]], it is recommended to try and kill hordes of Sinner Snaches long before they reach the enemy frontlines, making units like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Talents|Talented]] [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] highly recommended against it. While countering this enemy should rarely, if ever, be your priority, this same strategy can prove beneficial against most [[:Category:Death Surge Enemies|enemies with the Death Surge ability]] all the same.

As mentioned before, [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune]]/[[:Category:Resist Surge Cats|Surge-resistant Cats]] are also an option, considering the widespread prevalence of such abilities amongst Aku enemies.

